  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">.The objective of the project is to use media as an intrument to focus attention on organssed crime and corruption and reaise awareness on these issues among teh public an NGOs. In this project CIN expects to report and write approximately 25 in-depth stories on rogansied crime and corruption per year</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med insatsen &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka utrymmet f&#xf6;r medial exponering och granskning av korrutption och organiserad brottslighet. St&#xf6;det utg&#xe5;r till Centret f&#xf6;r Unders&#xf6;kande Journalistik (Center for Investigative Reporting, CIN, som under avtalsperioden har &#xe5;tagit sig att producera och publicera &#xe5;rligen runt 25 ber&#xe4;ttelser om korruption.</narrative>
  </description>
